    "title": "Winter storm warning prompts school closures, delays - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jessica Bringe ,\n1 days ago GRAND FORKS, N.D. (Valley News Live) - A winter storm warning is prompting the Grand Forks Public School District to transition to remote learning on Wednesday. In a post to families and students, the district said it plans to host a remote learning day and has already scheduled an early release. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
